    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ofzrqnfzjrxaascpoeonmrfswbuavguhppkcmvfhseaigdupvd.png\" /><br /><br />lone pair delocalized so less basic than aniline.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/iknxvlflmsxheidnosjduedduodrnolgucadwhwcvpumkcjcae.png\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>–</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> effect of <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> decrease the basicity so it is less basic than aniline.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/mpmaewvgbfrnxfgnduptmyvtyitqelrctmtbugltmuhcekcwmz.png\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> group at ortho so ortho effect exert here hence basic character decrease as compare to aniline.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/bghqayxaapccolfowhsggklkqslueaceimxiiyrseefbgwiqud.png\" /><br /><br />Lone pair of <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> involve in delocalization and ring become aromatic due to this so it is also less basic then aniline.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is more basic then aniline because phenyl group exert <math><mo>–</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> effect.<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is derivative of guanidine so they are more basic than aniline.",
